{"2778110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project ZETA", "steam_appid": 2778110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/76fb20b8d479ffb624056185f53b259e.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1200 height=350 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the official Project ZETA Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your squad, share strategies, and double the fun of Project ZETA along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get the latest game updates faster than anywhere else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk directly with the dev team, from real-time announcements to your own feedback. Let's share it all on Discord!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Aran Plateau.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the tale of a strange world, tangled together from humans and humanoids, dragons and monsters, and heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic that began with a humble librarian piling pebbles upon ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will this story lead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answer starts unfolding now, here in the Aran Plateau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Predict. Dash. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget your aim. Move by judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict the enemy's next move, dodge their strikes, and pierce through their gap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you steal their timing, the battlefield is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO DARES WINS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 teams clash for a single victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for it. Steal it. Or seize the moment while the others bleed each other dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide of the battlefield with your bold decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CONTROLS. YOUR FIGHT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard or controller, jump in the way you play best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is decided not by your setup, but by you.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/18135a8218914a059577253c5bf4afc7.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to the Aran Plateau.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the tale of a strange world, tangled together from humans and humanoids, dragons and monsters, and heroes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An epic that began with a humble librarian piling pebbles upon ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where will this story lead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answer starts unfolding now, here in the Aran Plateau.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/39602e1097234bd5bfbfbf9fb8530640.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Predict. Dash. Dominate.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget your aim. Move by judgment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Predict the enemy's next move, dodge their strikes, and pierce through their gap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment you steal their timing, the battlefield is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/a1f3c6674e9ac08b8f10de6162c64918.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHO DARES WINS.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 teams clash for a single victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight for it. Steal it. Or seize the moment while the others bleed each other dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn the tide of the battlefield with your bold decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.poster.avif?t=1787709640\" width=1170 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.webm?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/extras/59f158ae61b5093e9465d3f8989a84b2.mp4?t=1787709640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR CONTROLS. YOUR FIGHT.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard or controller, jump in the way you play best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory is decided not by your setup, but by you.</p>", "short_description": "Predict. Dash. Dominate. A 4-team Tactical Hero Arena where clever play meets original hero abilities without tipping the scale between controller and KBM. It’s not a typical hero shooter, battle royale, or MOBA. It’s Project ZETA. A Multi-team Tactical Arena.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Japanese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/a4220ac73a077238c115b423205c8bd34135e727/header.jpg?t=1787709640", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/558b444053d798d5831c682b5b4c773c2aa748fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787709640", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2778110/558b444053d798d5831c68